<p>This intricate spell instantly erects a time shield around the caster, preventing any incoming damage and sending it forward in time.</p><p>Once either the maximum damage (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">281, 378, 453, 517, 574</acronym>) is absorbed, or the time runs out (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns), the stored damage will return as a temporal restoration field over time (5 turns).</p><p>Each turn the restoration field is active, you get healed for 10% of the absorbed damage (Aegis Shielding talent affects the percentage).</p><p>The shield's max absorption will increase with your Spellpower.</p>